      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa wanyamukili budidi yayeni, afumini kuShitimi ashikili kuYodana, niyena nianyana kaIsarela ejima. Akamini kwenoku henohu achidi kanda azambuki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chimwahitili mafuku asatu atulala ahitilimukachi kachilombu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ayilejeli antu, nawu, Chimwakamona chimba ŋucha chitiyaŋenu chaYehova Nzambi yenu, niatupristu aLevi nakuchisenda, mwakanyamuka kumudi, mwakachilondela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mukachi kenu nachimbapu mwakashali iluŋa dakweseka neyi munkotweli jachikasa makombakaji ayedi. Bayi mwakaswila kwakwihi nachuku, kulonda mwakelukinjila yimwakayia, muloŋa njila iyi kanda muyihitapahu dehuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwawayilili antu, nindi, Dŋilikenu; muloŋa kumadiki Yehova wakela yihayamisha mukachi kenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa wahosheli nawatupristu, nindi, Nyamunenu chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu, musambilaŋahu dehi, antu ashali munyima. Anyamwini chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu, hiyakuyaŋahu dehi kumbidi, antu alondeleli munyima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova wamwilili Yoshuwa, nindi, Ifuku dalelu nukutachika kukutohesha kumesu awaIsarela ejima, kulonda akeluki nawu mwomunadiŋilaŋa naMosi dimu munukwikalila naneyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakaleja atupristu asendaŋa chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu, neyi, Chimukushika kwesekela meji aYodana, mwakemana muYodana ku-ka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa wayilili anyana kaIsarela, nindi, Inzenu kunu mutiyi mazu aYehova Nzambi yenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoshuwa nindi, Tiyenu mumwakelukila nenu Nzambi wamumi wudi mukachi kenu, mumwakelukila nenu wakayitemwina niaKenani, niaHiti, niaHivi, niaPerizi, niaGiragashi, niaAmori, niaYebusi kumukuyenu chakadi nikukaŋanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Talenu, chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu chaMwanta weseki dejima, china chikuhita nakwijila muYodana china. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi dinu tambulenu kwenu amayala ikumi nayedi amunyichidi yaIsarela, hamuchidi iyala wumu, hamuchidi iyala wumu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atupristu asendaŋa chimbaŋu chaYehova Mwanta weseki dejima, chakadatawu mumeji aYodana, mwakamona meji aYodana akaketuka ngwa, meji akwinza kuntu, akemana ibebi fwi-i.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nochu dimu mwamwenuwu, chafuminuwu antu kumatenti awu nawu azambuki Yodana, atupristu asendeli chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu hiyakutwaminaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chashikiluwu akwakusenda chimbaŋu kuYodana, nyendu yawatupristu asendeli chimbaŋu yeŋilili lwe kwesekela meji—muloŋa hachilaaka chakwaŋula kudya chejima Yodana wenzalaŋa to-o nihachikumu chindi chejima panda— ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "meji enjili kuntu hiyakwimana nikwimana, hiyakunyamuka nikwiwulu ibebi fwi-i, kwakulehi nankashi kwoku Adama, mukala wuna wakumaŋana naZaretani. Nimeji ana akunkumukili nakuya kwijiya dakuchana, dodu Ijiya Damuŋwa, aketukili chikupu ngwa. Antu azambukili kumululakenu naYeriku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atupristu asendeli chimbaŋu chachitiyaŋenu chaYehova emeni mbe hamaseki amomu chau mukachi kaYodana, niaIsarela ejima azambukili hamaseki amomu chau, nichichamanisniluwu kuzambuka Yodana muza wejima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
